 "pages": {
  "warehouse/30895.htm": {
   "file": "warehouse/30895.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Warehouse Keeper Kluck: Hello, adventurer! Welcome to the Iron Gate Guild of Heine. Are you here to make a deposit? A withdrawal? Perhaps you wish to learn skills? I feel like I have gotten so busy lately... No! Not just a feeling -- I am busy! Too busy to eat or sleep! That's the price of business…",
