  "warehouse/30895-4.htm": {
   "file": "warehouse/30895-4.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Warehouse Keeper Kluck: OK, let me get this straight. You're not a Dwarven Fighter, a Scavenger, or a Bounty Hunter. Why are we having this conversation? Did you hear me say how busy I am? The nerve of some people! Go away! Your education is not my concern!",
   "header": "Warehouse Keeper Kluck",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "warehouse/30895-noteach.htm": {
   "file": "warehouse/30895-noteach.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Warehouse Keeper Kluck: I've got much more important things to attend to than your education, got it? Let's get this over with. What's your profession? Dwarven Fighter?",
   "header": "Warehouse Keeper Kluck",
   "links": [
