   "quest": 354,
   "text": "Warehouse Freightman Kluck: Whew! There's no way I can keep up this pace! Hello, friend! Am I glad to see you! For as long as anyone can remember, Dwarves have been traders, am I right? And now come the Humans, with their friends in high places, taking over the trade routes in Innadril, Abella, and…",
