  "Q00140_ShadowFoxPart2/30895-05.html": {
   "file": "Q00140_ShadowFoxPart2/30895-05.html",
   "quest": 140,
   "text": "Warehouse Keeper Kluck: Have you hear of Lionel Hunter, one of the lords of Innadril? He was an amazing warrior. As a young man, he even defeated Water Dragon Fafurion single-handed! Ah, but that's not what's important...",
   "header": "Warehouse Keeper Kluck",
   "sets": {
    "cond": "2"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Keep listening.",
