  "Q00140_ShadowFoxPart2/30895-06.html": {
   "file": "Q00140_ShadowFoxPart2/30895-06.html",
   "quest": 140,
   "text": "Warehouse Keeper Kluck: It seems that the Sword of Othelotte actually exists. Its whereabouts are vague, but its scabbard was recently discovered. Magicians even saw the power of water -- the realm of Eva -- that flowed from the scabbard. Now we are trying to find out all we can about this blade...",
   "header": "Warehouse Keeper Kluck",
   "sets": {
    "cond": "2"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Keep listening.",
