   "quest": 140,
   "text": "Warehouse Keeper Kluck: Thanks to investigation, we believe that the sword and a secret document that accompanies it are in the possession of Dark Elf Magister Xenovia in Heine. Please convince her to give you leave to bring us the Cryptogram of the Goddess Sword ...",
   "header": "Warehouse Keeper Kluck",
   "sets": {
    "cond": "2"
