   "quest": 354,
   "text": "Warehouse Freightman Kluck: Well, then, here you go! Sign on the dotted line... Now, I'll read the Contract to you. Adventurer agrees to go to Alligator Island and kill the Crokian lads, dailaon lads, Crokian lad warriors, farhite lads, nos lads, and the Swamp Tribe and bring back their teeth as pr…",
   "header": "Warehouse Freightman Kluck",
   "sets": {
