  "Q00354_ConquestOfAlligatorIsland/30895-05.html": {
   "file": "Q00354_ConquestOfAlligatorIsland/30895-05.html",
   "quest": 354,
   "text": "Warehouse Freightman Kluck: OK, one more time... Adventurer agrees to go to Alligator Island and kill the Crokian lads, dailaon lads, Crokian lad warriors, farhite lads, nos lads, and the Swamp Tribe and bring back their teeth as proof. And Kluck, that's me, will count the number of teeth brought b…",
   "header": "Warehouse Freightman Kluck",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Back",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00354_ConquestOfAlligatorIsland 30895-04.html",
