  "Q00354_ConquestOfAlligatorIsland/30895-08.html": {
   "file": "Q00354_ConquestOfAlligatorIsland/30895-08.html",
   "quest": 354,
   "text": "Warehouse Freightman Kluck: Are you kidding? You expect something for nothing? Not around here, my friend! Go to Alligator Island immediately and bring me back some teeth! Do I need to read the Contract to you again?",
   "header": "Warehouse Freightman Kluck",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00354_ConquestOfAlligatorIsland/30895-09.html": {
   "file": "Q00354_ConquestOfAlligatorIsland/30895-09.html",
   "quest": 354,
   "text": "Warehouse Freightman Kluck: That's a good adventurer... Heh heh... This free trade zone will benefit us all!",
   "header": "Warehouse Freightman Kluck",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00354_ConquestOfAlligatorIsland/30895-10.html": {
   "file": "Q00354_ConquestOfAlligatorIsland/30895-10.html",
   "quest": 354,
   "text": "Warehouse Freightman Kluck: What a pity... You won't be easy to replace... I appreciate your contribution to our cause... When the free trade zone on Alligator Island becomes a reality and I have opened my own shop, you must visit me there. May the prosperity of Maphr be with you always...",
   "header": "Warehouse Freightman Kluck",
   "sets": {
    "exit": true
   },
   "outcome": "end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00354_ConquestOfAlligatorIsland/30895-12.html": {
   "file": "Q00354_ConquestOfAlligatorIsland/30895-12.html",
   "quest": 354,
   "text": "Warehouse Freightman Kluck: Hmm... A piece of Map, eh? I bet if we collected about 10 pieces just like it, we'd have a complete Map! Come to think of it, there is a rumor that part of the legendary treasure of Zaken the pirate is buried on Alligator Island. Zaken's boatswain's lover stole it and hi…",
   "header": "Warehouse Freightman Kluck",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00354_ConquestOfAlligatorIsland/30895-13.html": {
   "file": "Q00354_ConquestOfAlligatorIsland/30895-13.html",
   "quest": 354,
   "text": "Warehouse Freightman Kluck: Ah, yes, these pieces definitely go together... Just like doing a puzzle! What have we here? This mark must show where the treasure is hidden! This must surely be the Map to the legendary treasure of Zaken the pirate! Hmm, I suppose, according to the terms of the Contrac…",
   "header": "Warehouse Freightman Kluck",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
